<p class="post-intro">Do you know the real name of Fruit Attraction? 🍎🫐🍓</p>

<p>It's the Festival of Fresh Connections, Attractive Technologies, and Fruitful Opportunities :)</p>

<p>Plus DJ music, palms, old and new friends, and mind-blowing stand designs (I recorded some of them, I'll show you 😉)</p>

